FILE     fbbolt.nc (from line 1)
DIALECT  series 0 6 10 15 16 0i 30i (Macro B at line 8)
NOTE     the output assigns variables: the DX32 needs the PPPL option (param 285 bit 4)
NOTE     G0 with Z and X/Y: the DX32 moves Z first up or last down, FANUC all at once
NOTE     loops and jumps use labels L1-L1; do not call this from a loop that uses them
NOTE     1 called program(s) written as DX32 macros #1-#1, nested 1 deep
NOTE     the output needs BOSS 4-7 compatibility mode off
WROTE    fbwbolt.txt
NOTE     -check: dxsim: L12     WARN  feed move with no M3/M4 programmed: the spindle must already be on, or the control stops with SPINDLE NOT ON CANNOT CUT
CHECK    dxsim reads fbwbolt.txt cleanly and reaches all 19 FANUC end points in order (dxsim warnings above)
RESULT   ok
